      <uighur>köbege - köbegen</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хөвөө(н)</cyrillic>
      <transcript>KØBEGE(N)</transcript>
      <definition>[= købyge] n. Brim, border, trimming, edging; edge, hem, rim; bank of a river, shore.</definition>
      <page>476</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠥᠪᠡᠭᠡ ᠳᠡᠺᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- deki</transcript>
          <definition>Situated on the shore or bank, littoral.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠥᠪᠡᠭᠡ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ygei</transcript>
          <definition>Vast, infinite.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠡᠪᠡᠯ ᠤᠨ ᠺᠥᠪᠡᠭᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>debel yn --</transcript>
          <definition>Hem, border or a fur coat</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠠᠯᠠᠭᠠᠢ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠺᠥᠪᠡᠭᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>malaγai jin - -</transcript>
          <definition>Brim of a hat.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠥᠷᠡᠨ ᠤ ᠺᠥᠪᠡᠭᠡ</unicode>
